<title>UK: Brixton Estate MD takes early retirement.</title>
<headline>Brixton Estate MD takes early retirement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property developer Brixton Estate Plc said on Monday its managing director Terence Nagle had decided to take early retirement and will leave the company by the end of this month.</p>
<p>The company did not mention any reasons behind Nagle's decision. Brixton did not announce the name of his successor.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
